// File: zannastudio/src/ui/scene_editor_3d_camera_navigation.zia
// Purpose: Focused camera navigation behavior for the 3D scene editor controller.
// Key invariants:
//   - Each method overrides one contract slot while preserving shared controller state and transactional behavior.
// Ownership/Lifetime:
//   - The SceneEditor3D facade owns inherited resources; this layer adds no independent lifetime.
// Links: zannastudio/src/ui/scene_editor_3d.zia, zannastudio/src/ui/scene_editor_3d_inspector_hierarchy.zia
//
